Z||000001||FieroKyle||11-05-2001||11:15 PM||||What does banditballz have for a suspension!!!! I don't or feel the front end of my car lifting off the ground like that, may be it is, but I doubt it. Thats just way too cool for a stock guy. Looks like it was a great day. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||banditbalz||11-05-2001||11:25 PM||||Suspension consists of Eibach's springs all around. KYB shocks up front and GM Performance struts in the rear. Last season, I had a stock setup except for a coil was cut in each of the rear springs. I have pics right here and trust me, the car lifted the front just as high. I take out the jack and spare tire when i race, so this may be a 50lb reduction in the front. Lowering tire pressure increases my traction. I ran a best '60 foot time of 1.9 on sunday!<p>[This message has been edited by banditbalz (edited 11-05-2001).]||||reg||1
